            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I actually didn't use this as a salad topping, I used this as a coating for homemade chicken nuggets. I doubled everything, used a 1/4th of the salt and added onion powder. This was excellent as a nugget coating. The whole family loved it, especially my boys. I just used 1 tbsp. of EVOO in the bowl with the chicken and sprinkled the topping over the chicken, then baked it for 20-ish minutes. Really simple, really good."
          },
          {
