              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "bellepepper"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I scaled this to two servings, which was the perfect amount for a 1/4 recipe of Pasta Salad, by Cyndie, also on this site. I had all the ingredients on hand and this was a snap to put together. I toasted my sesame seeds to enhance their flavor (bake at 350 for about 6 minutes, until golden and fragrant). I think this seasoning really gave an added boost of flavor to the pasta salad.",
            "datePublished": "2012-03-28T14:14:58.393Z"
          },
